abstract: "IaC-Guard-V is a fail-closed verifier for infrastructure-as-code security repairs, selected scanner-independent semantic properties, and declared infrastructure intent contracts. It binds witness-first native and scanner evidence to protected deterministic Terraform and Kubernetes artifacts, including bounded Helm and Kustomize materialization."
keywords:
  - infrastructure-as-code
  - devsecops
  - security
  - verification
  - terraform
  - kubernetes
  - helm
  - kustomize
  - checkov
  - ai-coding-agents
